
This folder contains python scripts to reproduce the figures in the "Roadmap on machine learning glassy liquids"

FIG2: Pearson correlation of different models with the propensity of displacement) at T=0.44

FIG6: Pearson correlation of different models with the propensity of displacement) for different temperatures analyzing transferability

FIG7: Dynamic susceptibility chi4 to quantify dynamic heterogeneities at different temperatures for the different models.

For each figure a python script (.py) is provided which evaluates the KA_models dataset. The results can be visualized using the gnuplot scripts (.g)
